{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 10, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Mark, for thy journey to the fair land of Japan, a path shall be set, through cities old and new, where culture's tapestry unfolds in grandeur and grace.\n\nFirst, to the capital city, Tokyo, where modernity and tradition dance in harmony. There, in the heart of the city, visit the Imperial Palace, a symbol of Japan's regal history, and stroll through the gardens, where time seems to stand still.\n\nNext, to Kyoto, the former capital, where echoes of the past still resonate. Wander through the ancient temples, such as Kinkaku-ji, the Golden Pavilion, and the serene gardens of Ryoan-ji. There, find solace in the beauty of nature and the artistry of human hands.\n\nThen, to the mountains of Hakone, where the majesty of nature awaits. Take a boat ride on Lake Ashi, where the mountain's reflection stretches out like a mirror. And do not forget to visit the hot springs, where the spirits of the earth rise to soothe thy weary bones.\n\nLastly, to Osaka, the city of culinary delights. Partake in the local cuisine, from takoyaki to okonomiyaki, and visit the Osaka Castle, a testament to the city's rich history. There, in the vibrant streets, feel the pulse of a city that never sleeps.\n\nThus, thy journey shall unfold, a tale of culture, nature, and culinary delight, in the fair land of Japan.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Mark", "logprob": -6.124042510986328}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -1.1950935125350952}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -2.801006317138672}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -1.4886019229888916}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.2956225574016571}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.16820329427719116}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.3722802400588989}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -4.080289363861084}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -0.16975590586662292}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.004320810083299875}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.398731